# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trigger.dev — Environment Variables
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trigger.dev v4 keeps the project ref in trigger.config.mjs,
# not in .env. The only env var you may need here is:
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Optional: REST API key ─────────────────────────────────
# Needed only if you want to complete approval waitpoints
# programmatically via the Trigger.dev REST API instead of
# using the Dashboard.
#
# Generate one from Dashboard → Settings → API Keys.
# TRIGGER_API_KEY=tr_apikey_...

# ── Demo server ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not needed by Trigger.dev directly — used by the task code
# at runtime. Defaults to http://localhost:3100.
# DEMO_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3100
